  "notes": "Dual-purpose surface runner. T7 thrusters on a 265t hull give huge thrust-to-weight for high-g landings, plus top speed of any medium for HGE positioning. RAW/HGE mats: SRV prospecting + Wake Scanner for encoded data + twin heat sinks for star-side dives. GUARDIAN farming: the size-6 SRV hangar carries multiple buggies (Sentinels blow up SRVs, so you redeploy without flying home), and the cargo rack holds the Ancient Relic/Casket/Tablet/Totem/Urn commodities you load to activate obelisks. Guardian mats themselves come from shooting Sentinels with the SRV — the ship just delivers you, survives the landing, and hauls the relics.",
